# Build context filter for phase2-mlops/Dockerfile.
#
# The build context is the REPOSITORY ROOT (the image needs ../shared), so these
# patterns are repo-root relative. Docker only reads the ignore file at the
# context root, so the repository root has a `.dockerignore` symlink pointing
# here -- one file, one source of truth.
#
# Keeping the context small speeds up builds and, more importantly, stops local
# experiment data and virtualenvs from being shipped into an image.

# --- version control & editor/tooling metadata ---
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github/
.idea/
.vscode/
.claude/
**/.gitignore
**/*.md

# --- virtualenvs (huge, platform-specific, never valid inside the image) ---
.venv/
venv/
env/
**/.venv/
**/venv/

# --- python caches & build leftovers ---
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info/
**/build/
**/dist/
.pytest_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
build/
dist/

# --- phase 1 training code and its local experiment data ---
# The service receives a model at runtime through MODEL_URI; it must never be
# baked in at build time.
phase1-mlops/
**/mlflow.db
**/mlflow.db-journal
**/mlartifacts/
**/mlruns/

# --- phase 2 files that are not part of the runtime image ---
phase2-mlops/tests/
phase2-mlops/requirements-dev.txt
phase2-mlops/Dockerfile
phase2-mlops/.dockerignore
phase2-mlops/export/

# --- 第四阶段：只有 app/ 需要进镜像，监控栈的配置与产物都不需要 ---
phase4-mlops/monitoring/
phase4-mlops/grafana/
phase4-mlops/prometheus/
phase4-mlops/reports/
phase4-mlops/docker-compose.yml
phase4-mlops/Dockerfile

# --- 第五阶段：告警/重训脚本不属于推理镜像 ---
phase5-mlops/

# --- OS noise ---
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
